{
  "info": {
    "name": "FraudGuard",
    "description": "Real-time fraud detection platform — ingestion-svc (7777) + detection-svc (7778)\n\n=== CARA PAKAI ===\n1. Buka folder skenario (Membership / Bank / E-Commerce)\n2. Jalankan ✅ Positive Case dulu (harus sukses, CLEAN)\n3. Jalankan ❌ Negative Case (harus FRAUD atau 4xx error)\n4. Cek hasil via GET /api/transactions/{id} (cek isFlaggedFraud)\n5. Lihat fraud breakdown via GET /stats?tenantId=MEMBERSHIP\n6. Webhook akan auto-terkirim jika diaktifkan (default: disabled)\n\n=== DETECTION FLOW ===\nPOST /transactions → Ingestion → DB → Redis Pub/Sub → Detection → Webhook/Redis result\n\n=== NOTE ===\nWebhook disabled by default (fraudguard.webhook.enabled=false).\nDetection tetap berjalan normal — cek hasil via GET /api/transactions/{id}.\nAktifkan webhook dengan set property ke true + restart detection-svc.\nPOST /transactions → Ingestion → DB → Redis Pub/Sub → Detection → Webhook/Redis result",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Membership — Loyalty Point System",
      "description": "=== LIFECYCLE RULES ===\n• TOPUP  → selalu diizinkan (tidak ada syarat)\n• REDEEM → harus ada TOPUP duluan (user yang sama, tenant yang sama)\n• EARN   → harus ada REDEEM duluan (user yang sama, tenant yang sama)\n\n=== URUTAN POSITIVE CASE ===\n1. POST /webhooks (register URL callback)\n2. POST TOPUP    → expected: CLEAN\n3. POST REDEEM   → expected: CLEAN (ada prior TOPUP)\n4. POST EARN     → expected: CLEAN (ada prior REDEEM)\n\n=== URUTAN NEGATIVE CASE ===\n1. POST REDEEM (user baru) → expected: FRAUD, isFlaggedFraud=true\n2. POST EARN   (user baru) → expected: FRAUD, isFlaggedFraud=true\n\nSetiap FRAUD → Webhook otomatis terkirim ke URL yang didaftarkan → Membership BLOCK transaksi",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "=== ✅ POSITIVE CASES (expected: CLEAN) ===",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "1. Setup — Register Webhook Callback",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "description": "Setup awal: daftarkan URL callback Membership agar terima alert fraud. HTTPS only, private IP blocked.",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\"tenantId\":\"MEMBERSHIP\",\"url\":\"https://membership.example.com/webhook\",\"secret\":\"sec-membership-2026\"}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{detection_url}}/api/webhooks",
                  "host": [
                    "{{detection_url}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "webhooks"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "2. TOPUP — User isi saldo loyalty point",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "description": "✅ EXPECTED: 200 OK, lifecycle CLEAN\nUser USER_A topup 500rb. TOPUP selalu diizinkan — LifecycleCheck skip.\nnameOrig=ID user, nameDest=SYSTEM, tenantId=MEMBERSHIP.\noldBalanceOrg=0 → newBalanceOrig=500000 (konsisten, BalanceAnomaly juga skip).",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\"step\":1,\"type\":\"TOPUP\",\"amount\":500000.00,\"nameOrig\":\"USER_A\",\"nameDest\":\"SYSTEM\",\"oldBalanceOrg\":0,\"newBalanceOrig\":500000.00,\"tenantId\":\"MEMBERSHIP\"}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{ingestion_url}}/api/transactions",
                  "host": [
                    "{{ingestion_url}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "transactions"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "3. REDEEM — User tukar point beli product",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "description": "✅ EXPECTED: 200 OK, lifecycle CLEAN\nUSER_A redeem 250rb. LifecycleCheck cek: USER_A punya TOPUP di step sebelumnya? YES → CLEAN.\nSaldo: 500rb → 250rb (konsisten). nameDest berisi ID tiket/tujuan.",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\"step\":2,\"type\":\"REDEEM\",\"amount\":250000.00,\"nameOrig\":\"USER_A\",\"nameDest\":\"PRODUCT_BOOKING_SHUTTLE\",\"oldBalanceOrg\":500000.00,\"newBalanceOrig\":250000.00,\"tenantId\":\"MEMBERSHIP\"}",
                  "options": {
