    {
      "name": "2. Bank — Transfer Anti-Fraud",
      "description": "=== DETECTION RULES ===\n• VelocityCheck:  >3 transaksi TRANSFER/CASH_OUT dalam 2 step → FRAUD\n• BalanceAnomaly: saldo habis total ATAU saldo nol tapi transaksi besar → FRAUD\n\n=== URUTAN POSITIVE CASE ===\n1. POST /webhooks (register)\n2. Transfer normal (1-3 kali) → CLEAN\n\n=== URUTAN NEGATIVE CASE ===\n1. Transfer >3 kali dalam window → FRAUD (VelocityCheck)\n2. Transfer habiskan saldo → FRAUD (BalanceAnomaly)\n3. Transfer besar dari saldo 0 → FRAUD (BalanceAnomaly)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "=== ✅ POSITIVE CASES ===",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "1. Setup — Register Webhook",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\"tenantId\":\"BANK\",\"url\":\"https://bank.example.com/webhook\",\"secret\":\"sec-bank-2026\"}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{detection_url}}/api/webhooks",
                  "host": [
                    "{{detection_url}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "webhooks"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "2. Transfer Normal — 1 transaksi",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "description": "✅ EXPECTED: 200 OK, CLEAN\nCUSTOMER_A transfer 500rb ke CUSTOMER_B. Saldo awal 5.1jt → sisa 4.6jt (konsisten).\nVelocityCheck: hanya 1 transaksi, di bawah threshold 3 → CLEAN.\nBalanceAnomaly: saldo akhir >0, saldo awal >0 → CLEAN.",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\"step\":1,\"type\":\"TRANSFER\",\"amount\":500000.00,\"nameOrig\":\"CUSTOMER_A\",\"nameDest\":\"CUSTOMER_B\",\"oldBalanceOrg\":5100000.00,\"newBalanceOrig\":4600000.00,\"tenantId\":\"BANK\"}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{ingestion_url}}/api/transactions",
                  "host": [
                    "{{ingestion_url}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "transactions"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "3. CASH_OUT Normal — Penarikan Tunai",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "description": "✅ EXPECTED: 200 OK, CLEAN\nCUSTOMER_A tarik tunai 200rb. CASH_OUT juga dicek VelocityCheck + BalanceAnomaly.\nSaldo konsisten: 4.6jt → 4.4jt. Masih di bawah threshold velocity.",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\"step\":1,\"type\":\"CASH_OUT\",\"amount\":200000.00,\"nameOrig\":\"CUSTOMER_A\",\"nameDest\":\"ATM_BCA\",\"oldBalanceOrg\":4600000.00,\"newBalanceOrig\":4400000.00,\"tenantId\":\"BANK\"}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{ingestion_url}}/api/transactions",
                  "host": [
                    "{{ingestion_url}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "transactions"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "=== ❌ NEGATIVE CASES ===",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "1. Velocity Fraud — >3 Transfer dalam 1 Step",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "description": "❌ EXPECTED: isFlaggedFraud=true, triggered=[VelocityCheck]\nCARA TEST: Kirim request ini 4x berturut-turut (pakai Postman Runner atau klik Send 4x).\n• Transfer ke-1: CLEAN  • Transfer ke-4: FRAUD (VelocityCheck >3 in window)\n• Transfer ke-2: CLEAN  • Webhook otomatis terkirim → BLOCK\n• Transfer ke-3: CLEAN\nIni mensimulasikan bot/script yang transfer berkali-kali dalam waktu singkat.",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\"step\":2,\"type\":\"TRANSFER\",\"amount\":100000.00,\"nameOrig\":\"BOT_ACCOUNT\",\"nameDest\":\"DEST_1\",\"oldBalanceOrg\":5000000.00,\"newBalanceOrig\":4900000.00,\"tenantId\":\"BANK\"}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
